id=pixel_tune
name=Pixel Tune
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=3
author=local
description=Reversible performance, thermal and power tuning for the Pixel 8a (Tensor G3). Profiles via uclamp cgroups and the Mali scaling_max_freq, optional zram size (the lz77eh algorithm is never changed), charge limit, per-app Game Mode. Writes to neither /system nor /vendor, SELinux stays Enforcing. Control it from the WebUI (webroot/index.html) or the pxtune CLI. Bootloop protection via boot_count.
webuiIcon=icon.png
